language js

// An assertion through `unknown` (`x as unknown as T`) TypeScript accepts
// whatever the two types are: it steps around the type checker. Counted per
// occurrence by scripts/escape-hatch-ratchet.ts, which runs this plugin alone
// (Biome has no per-file count of its own); the span is the asserted type,
// the shape the ratchet holds.
`$x as unknown as $t` as $hit where {
  register_diagnostic(span=$t, message="An assertion through unknown: parse the value (a schema) or type it.")
}
